<title>INDIA: Indian adhoc t-bills at 34.55 bln on Dec 20-RBI.</title>
<headline>Indian adhoc t-bills at 34.55 bln on Dec 20-RBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The net issue of ad hoc treasury bills on December 20, 1996 was 34.55 billion over the March 31, 1996 level, the Reserve Bank of India said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It was 86.15 billion rupees on December 13, the statement added.</p>
